2:["$","p","Depth of field should correspond to camera distance. Background blur is not a universal fix; excessive blur can hide errors while making the photograph feel artificial.",{"children":"Depth of field should correspond to camera distance. Background blur is not a universal fix; excessive blur can hide errors while making the photograph feel artificial."}]
3:["$","section","Inspect the composite",{"id":"s3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Inspect the composite"}],[["$","p","Check hair edges, transparent areas, gaps between fingers, floor contact and color spill. Look for duplicated accessories or changed clothing details.",{"children":"Check hair edges, transparent areas, gaps between fingers, floor contact and color spill. Look for duplicated accessories or changed clothing details."}],["$","p","Make one environmental change at a time. If you also need wardrobe replacement or face retouching, complete and review each step separately.",{"children":"Make one environmental change at a time. If you also need wardrobe replacement or face retouching, complete and review each step separately."}]]]}]
